<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Strings for the parent app's three tabs and their detail screens.

  A file of its own so the parent redesign, the child redesign and the overlay redesign can
  land in parallel without editing the same lines of strings.xml. Existing parent strings that
  are still used stay where they are.

  Nothing here may describe a message's text. Every line a parent reads about a warning is a
  category, a severity, an outcome and a coarse time - see SupervisionEvent.
-->
